      "content": "That's a good start for the economic stuff. Can you expand on those points? Like, can you give me more specifics on the \"stifling innovation\" part? I want to be able to explain how these regulations actually make it harder for us to invest in new tech rather than just spending it all on compliance fees. Also, if the reps counter with the environmental necessity of these rules, how should I address that without sounding like I don't care about the planet?",
